{ dg-modules "genietransput" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Execute a system command", ALGOL 68 solution execute-a-system-command-2.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Execute_a_system_command#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/execute-a-system-command-2.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Genie_Transput (
op ! = (string cmd)bool: system(cmd) = 0;

if ! "touch test.tmp" ANDF ( ! "ls test.tmp" ANDF ! "rm test.tmp" ) then
  print (("test.tmp now gone!", new_line))
fi
)
